<title>USA: TJX Cos Inc Q3 net shr rises.</title>
<headline>TJX Cos Inc Q3 net shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net shr		    $0.97		    $0.44</p>
<p> Oper shr		    0.90		     0.35</p>
<p> Net			 87,510		   33,877</p>
<p> Sales		  1,722,429		  861,214</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  90,630		   76,858</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Net shr		    $1.70		    $0.16</p>
<p> Oper shr		    1.53		     0.53</p>
<p> Net			153,650		   17,100</p>
<p> Sales		 4,742,935		2,336,376</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  90,574		   72,484</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate was $0.82 per share</p>
<p>Q3 1996 includes gain of $0.10 per share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 includes charge of $2.9 million, or $0.03 per share, from the early retirement of debt.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
